Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:41.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}你才会想倾聆我们的声音
